# Agent Directives for Raven CMS Smallweb Extension

Follow the project root guide plus `private/ext/AGENTS.md` for Raven-wide architecture and extension contracts.

If any part of Raven's generic extension-building process is vague or unclear, note it in this directory's `build-notes.md` so it can be handed back to core maintenance.

## Webroot Data Transfer

- Enabled protocol tabs expose archive-based import and export controls for the
  current webroot.
- Imports accept the shared Raven package archive formats, reject empty archives,
  flatten a single wrapper directory, and merge extracted files into the
  selected protocol without deleting unrelated local entries.
- Bare `.tar` uploads are normalized through the shared TAR handler because PHP upload
  temporary paths do not retain the original filename suffix.
- Exports use the shared directory archive formats and are unavailable when the
  selected webroot is empty.
